{:edb/db-before-t 400 :edb/db-after-t 401 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533713 50 #inst "2026-10-04T18:20:51.288Z" 13194139533713 true] [17592186087627 1020 #edb/ref 17592186247968 13194139533713 true] [17592186087628 1020 #edb/ref 17592186247961 13194139533713 true] [17592186087628 1020 #edb/ref 17592186247971 13194139533713 true] [17592186087628 1020 #edb/ref 17592186247975 13194139533713 true] [17592186088206 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533713 true] [17592186088206 1145 "First, we take $ln$ of both sides of the equation and solve for $x$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{1-2x} & =5 \\\\ ln⁡({e}^{1-2x}) & =ln⁡(5) \\\\ 1-2x & =ln⁡(5) \\\\ -2x & =ln⁡(5)-1 \\\\ x & =\\frac{1-ln⁡(5)}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating the above expression using a calculator gives\n\n$$\nx≈-0.305\n$$\n\nrounded to $3$ decimal places." 13194139533713 true] [17592186247961 1017 #edb/ref 17592186247962 13194139533713 true] [17592186247961 1089 "q-110536" 13194139533713 true] [17592186247961 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533713 true] [17592186247961 1100 "Given that ${e}^{y+1}-1=3,$ then $y=$" 13194139533713 true] [17592186247961 1113 #uuid "2335269b-5050-525c-bd6e-7954e002a26e" 13194139533713 true] [17592186247961 1138 false 13194139533713 true] [17592186247961 1145 "First, we rearrange our equation into a form that is more convenient for logarithms, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{y+1}-1 & =3 \\\\ {e}^{y+1} & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we find the natural logarithm $(ln)$ of both sides of the equation and solve for $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{y+1} & =4 \\\\ ln⁡({e}^{y+1}) & =ln⁡(4) \\\\ y+1 & =2ln⁡(2) \\\\ y & =2ln⁡(2)-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $y=2ln⁡(2)-1.$" 13194139533713 true] [17592186247962 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247963 13194139533713 true] [17592186247962 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247964 13194139533713 true] [17592186247962 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247965 13194139533713 true] [17592186247962 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247966 13194139533713 true] [175